WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.070
The fluidised-bed belt freezer receives
par-fried strips.

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.957
Its training release depends on both cold-zone
residence and a fresh zone measurement.

00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:15.145
Connect return-air temperature to AI08 and the
freezer belt speed demand to AO08.

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:18.657
Check the value, quality and sample time
together.

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:22.191
Set the training cold-zone residence to 12
minutes.

00:00:22.261 --> 00:00:25.575
This is the simulator target for the fictional
recipe.

00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:28.074
Inject a stale return-air sample.

00:00:28.144 --> 00:00:32.793
The display may still show a plausible number
while the current condition is unknown.

00:00:33.003 --> 00:00:36.353
Restore a fresh air measurement and confirm zone
readiness.

00:00:36.423 --> 00:00:42.848
The model carries 744.7 kilograms through this
stage without a mass adjustment.
